  ('lianggongformwork', 'scaffolding', 'Lianggong High Strength H20 Timber Beam Steel Aluminum Plastic Wall Column Slab Formwork for Concrete Construction', null, 'Lianggong High Strength H20 Timber Beam Steel Aluminum Plastic Wall Column Slab Formwork for Concrete Construction. Customizable Dimensions: Max width 6m x height 12m; plywood size 2x6m customizable. Adjustable Beam Spacing: Adjust layout space between H20 and walers based on concrete pressure. Flexible Column Adjustment: Flexible adjustment for column dimensions to fit various project needs. High Load Capacity: H20 beams (80mm wide) support various loads up to 6m length. Durable Steel Components: Welded double U profile steel walers (100/120) with slot holes. Versatile Applications: Ideal for LNG tanks, dams, high-rise buildings, bridges, and nuclear projects. One-Stop Service: Includes design, manufacture, delivery, and after-sales support. Professional Technical Support: Free Auto-CAD drawings and site supervision services available.', null, '[{"label_en":"Material","label_es":"Material","value":"Steel"},{"label_en":"Type","label_es":"Tipo","value":"Wall Formwork"},{"label_en":"Contained Material","label_es":"Contained Material","value":"Q235 Steel, Timber Beam, Plywood"},{"label_en":"Size","label_es":"Tamaño","value":"Universal Forming"},{"label_en":"Fresh Concrete Pressure Adjustment","label_es":"Fresh Concrete Pressure Adjustment","value":"Adjust Layout Space Between H20 and Walers"},{"label_en":"Column Dimension Adjustment","label_es":"Column Dimension Adjustment","value":"Flexible Adjustment"},{"label_en":"Max Width X Height","label_es":"Max Width X Height","value":"6m X 12m"},{"label_en":"Application","label_es":"Aplicación","value":"LNG Tanks, Dam, High-Rise Building, Bridge Tower"},{"label_en":"Beam","label_es":"Beam","value":"H20, Width: 80mm, Length: 1-6m, Permitted Bending"},{"label_en":"Steel Waler","label_es":"Steel Waler","value":"Welded Double U Profile 100/120, Slot Holes for Un"}]', 'm