  ('lyglongyi', 'timber-plywood', 'Factory Direct 4X8 OSB Panel Waterproof OSB 9.5 mm', null, 'Factory Direct 4X8 OSB Panel Waterproof OSB 9.5 mm. Waterproof & Durable: Waterproof, resistant to rot, decay, corrosion, and fire with consistent performance in wet environments. High Strength Construction: Tight construction with high strength, minimum twisting, delamination, or warping for dimensional stability. Low Formaldehyde Emission: Environmentally friendly with low formaldehyde emission, ensuring safe indoor air quality. Easy Processing: Good nailing strength, easy to saw, nail, drill, groove, plane, file, or polish for versatile applications. Customizable Options: Full customization available including size, thickness, and design from customer requests or samples. Versatile Applications: Ideal for roof decking, wall sheathing, flooring, packing, hoarding, signboards, and portable buildings. Multiple Grades Available: Available in OSB-2, OSB-3, and OSB-4 grades to suit dry, humid, and heavy-duty load-bearing conditions. Fast Delivery: Delivery within 20 days after receiving advance payment or original L/C at sight.', null, '[{"label_en":"Feature","label_es":"Feature","value":"Waterproof"},{"label_en":"Density","label_es":"Density","value":"620-730kg/M3"},{"label_en":"Moisture","label_es":"Moisture","value":"3%-12%"},{"label_en":"Shape","label_es":"Forma","value":"Square"},{"label_en":"Color","label_es":"Color","value":"Yellow"},{"label_en":"Surface Finishing","label_es":"Acabado superficial","value":"Finished"}]', 'm3', 40, 15, 300, array['https://image.made-in-china.com/203f0j00OwPCKantZQoU/Factory-Direct-4X8-OSB-Panel-Waterproof-OSB-9-5-mm.webp', 'https://image.made-in-china.com/203f0j00NdHeKpOnStbf/Factory-Direct-4X8-OSB-Panel-Waterproof-OSB-9-5-mm.webp', 'https://image.made-in-china.com/203f0j00NmPeShOGrQbU/Factory-Direct-4X8-OSB-Panel-Waterproof-OSB-9-5-mm.webp', 'https://image.made-in-china.com/203f0j00OJLCSenWSEcG/Factory-Direct-4X8-OSB-Panel-Waterproof-OS