  ('yuantongtruck', 'trailers', 'Sinotruk HOWO 6X4 Tractor Head 371HP Semi-Trailer Tractor Truck for Africa', null, 'Sinotruk HOWO 6X4 Tractor Head 371HP Semi-Trailer Tractor Truck for Africa. Dual-Drive Traction System: 6x4 configuration with MCY13 axles ensures superior traction and prevents wheel slip on slopes. High-Strength Frame Design: Double-layer frame (8+5mm) offers high torsional rigidity and resists deformation under heavy loads. Long-Range Fuel Capacity: 600L large-capacity fuel tank supports long-distance driving and cross-border logistics operations. Comfortable High-Roof Cabin: H78L dual-bunk cab with air suspension, Wi-Fi, and climate control minimizes driver fatigue. Lightweight & Fuel Efficient: Aluminum alloy components reduce curb weight to 8.8 tons, boosting payload and fuel economy. Versatile Steering Options: Available in both LHD and RHD configurations to suit different regional driving standards. Global Spare Parts Availability: Spare parts widely available across African countries for convenient local maintenance.', null, '[{"label_en":"Transmission Type","label_es":"Transmission Type","value":"Manual"},{"label_en":"Power","label_es":"Potencia","value":"Diesel"},{"label_en":"Load Capacity","label_es":"Load Capacity","value":"31-40t"},{"label_en":"Emission Standard","label_es":"Emission Standard","value":"Euro 3"},{"label_en":"Drive Wheel","label_es":"Drive Wheel","value":"6×4"},{"label_en":"Seats","label_es":"Seats","value":"≤5"},{"label_en":"Horsepower","label_es":"Horsepower","value":"351-450hp"},{"label_en":"Engine Capacity","label_es":"Engine Capacity","value":"＞8L"},{"label_en":"Tire Certification","label_es":"Tire Certification","value":"ECE, GCC, ISO, DOT"},{"label_en":"Tire Design","label_es":"Tire Design","value":"Radial"}]', 'piece', 1, 15, 10500, array['https://image.made-in-china.com/203f0j00zmvWGTHcaFUY/Sinotruk-HOWO-6X4-Tractor-Head-371HP-Semi-Trailer-Tractor-Truck-for-Africa.webp', 'https://image.made-in-china.com/203f0j00rd