  ('yuantongtruck', 'trailers', 'Heavy Duty 3 Axle 50 Ton Dump Semi-Trailer Wear-Resistant Manganese Steel Tipper', null, 'Heavy Duty 3 Axle 50 Ton Dump Semi-Trailer Wear-Resistant Manganese Steel Tipper. 3-axle design, total load capacity up to 40-100 tons, 30% more load than 2-axle, one trip equals two, transport efficiency doubled. All 3 axles equipped with 10-12 leaf thickened steel springs, with hydraulic shock absorber, stable driving on bumpy roads, protects cargo and frame. Main longitudinal beam welded with high-strength manganese steel, web thickness 8-10mm, anti-twist no deformation, stable and reliable for long-term heavy load operation. Standard volume 30-40 CBM (45-50 CBM enlarged optional), U-type / square body optional, hauls more per trip, reduces transport trips and cost. Smooth inner wall, inclined floor design, rear door automatic locking, clean dumping no residue, no sticking no waste, dumping time ,<20 seconds. Wear-resistant cargo box long service life, FUWA axle spare parts cheap and easy to find, low hydraulic system failure rate, low long-term maintenance cost.', null, '[{"label_en":"Type","label_es":"Tipo","value":"Semi-Trailer"},{"label_en":"Load Capacity","label_es":"Load Capacity","value":"50T"},{"label_en":"Wheel Base","label_es":"Wheel Base","value":"7000-8000mm"},{"label_en":"Tread","label_es":"Tread","value":"1820mm"},{"label_en":"Grade","label_es":"Grado","value":"Heavy Duty"},{"label_en":"Types of Suspension Systems","label_es":"Types of Suspension Systems","value":"Leaf Spring Suspension"},{"label_en":"Shape","label_es":"Forma","value":"Van-type"},{"label_en":"Axle Number","label_es":"Axle Number","value":"3"},{"label_en":"Tire Number","label_es":"Tire Number","value":"12"},{"label_en":"Self-dumping","label_es":"Self-dumping","value":"Self-dumping"}]', 'piece', 1, 15, 8888, array['https://image.made-in-china.com/203f0j00YdfloOmJynRL/Heavy-Duty-3-Axle-50-Ton-Dump-Semi-Trailer-Wear-Resistant-Manganese-Steel-Tipper.webp', 'https://i