  ('yuantongtruck', 'trailers', '4 Axle High Fence Semi Trailer for Construction Material Transport', null, '4 Axle High Fence Semi Trailer for Construction Material Transport. 4-axle design, total load capacity up to 40-50 tons, 30% more load than 2-axle, hauls more per trip, high transport efficiency. Side panel height up to 1.8-2.2m, volume 50-70 CBM, 30% more capacity than standard side wall trailer, suitable for light cargo, agricultural products and livestock transport. Main longitudinal beam welded with high-strength manganese steel, web thickness 8-10mm, anti-twist no deformation, stable and reliable for long-term heavy load operation. Stake vertical bars and side panels are removable, flexibly adjustable according to cargo type, high fence for livestock, remove panels for building materials, one trailer for multiple uses. Densified and thickened stake posts, 30-40cm spacing, impact resistant no deformation, no livestock escape, no bulk cargo spillage. Stake structure provides good ventilation, no stuffiness when transporting livestock, vegetables and fruits, reduces cargo loss, especially suitable for African agricultural and livestock markets. Stake structure, side double doors, rear door fully openable, convenient and fast loading/unloading, reduces waiting time, 2-3 more trips per day.', null, '[{"label_en":"Type","label_es":"Tipo","value":"Semi-Trailer"},{"label_en":"Load Capacity","label_es":"Load Capacity","value":"50T"},{"label_en":"Wheel Base","label_es":"Wheel Base","value":"1300+1300"},{"label_en":"Tread","label_es":"Tread","value":"2240mm"},{"label_en":"Grade","label_es":"Grado","value":"Medium Duty"},{"label_en":"Types of Suspension Systems","label_es":"Types of Suspension Systems","value":"Hydro-Pneumatic Suspension"},{"label_en":"Shape","label_es":"Forma","value":"Van-type"},{"label_en":"Axle Number","label_es":"Axle Number","value":"4"},{"label_en":"Tire Number","label_es":"Tire Number","value":"12"},{"label_en":"Self-dumping","label_es":"Sel