  ('yuantongtruck', 'trailers', 'Semi Trailer Tractor 3-Axle Lowbed Semi-Trailer for General Construction', null, 'Semi Trailer Tractor 3-Axle Lowbed Semi-Trailer for General Construction. High-Strength Low-Deck Design: Built with high-strength steel frame and low deck to lower gravity center for heavy machinery. Heavy-Duty Foldable Ramps: Spring buffer structure allows tracked machinery to drive on and off easily with high safety. Double-Side Support Legs: 28T load capacity legs prevent rollover and ensure stable standalone operation during parking. Customizable Colors: Color can be customized according to buyer''s specific requirements. Versatile Traction Pin: Available in 50mm or 90mm sizes to fit various towing vehicle standards. Robust Suspension System: Mechanical suspension with 10/10/10 steel springs ensures stability in long-distance transport. Comprehensive After-Sales: Includes video technical support, overseas call centers, and one-year warranty coverage. ECE Certified Quality: Product meets ECE certification standards for safety and performance in international markets.', null, '[{"label_en":"Type","label_es":"Tipo","value":"Semi-Trailer"},{"label_en":"Load Capacity","label_es":"Load Capacity","value":"50T"},{"label_en":"Wheel Base","label_es":"Wheel Base","value":"1300+1300"},{"label_en":"Tread","label_es":"Tread","value":"1820mm"},{"label_en":"Grade","label_es":"Grado","value":"Light Duty"},{"label_en":"Types of Suspension Systems","label_es":"Types of Suspension Systems","value":"Hydro-Pneumatic Suspension"},{"label_en":"Shape","label_es":"Forma","value":"Flatbed"},{"label_en":"Axle Number","label_es":"Axle Number","value":"3"},{"label_en":"Tire Number","label_es":"Tire Number","value":"12"},{"label_en":"Self-dumping","label_es":"Self-dumping","value":"Not Self-dumping"}]', 'piece', 1, 15, 6880, array['https://image.made-in-china.com/203f0j00kuovaAEGZngw/Semi-Trailer-Tractor-3-Axle-Lowbed-Semi-Trailer-for-General-Construction.webp', 'https://image.ma