  ('frametec', 'building-material-machines', 'Fully Automatic Steel Stud & Track Roll Forming Machine with C/U Shape', null, 'Fully Automatic Steel Stud & Track Roll Forming Machine with C/U Shape. Multi-Profile Production: Produces C/U shape steel studs, tracks, and floor joists for 1-6 story buildings. High-Speed Efficiency: Maximum speed of 82FT (25m) per minute with comprehensive speed of 26FT (8m) per minute. Advanced CNC Control: LG-R300 control system with industry computer, supporting CSV input and automatic size changing. Durable Roller System: 13 groups of Cr12 MOV steel rollers, HRC60-62 hardness, ensuring long life and precision. Hydraulic Decoiler: 3-ton loading capacity, auto-feeding, and independent PLC control for easy operation. CE & ISO Certified: Machine meets CE and ISO9001 standards for quality and safety assurance. Customizable Dimensions: Widths from 140mm to 305mm and thicknesses from 1.0mm to 2.5mm are customizable.', null, '[{"label_en":"Customized","label_es":"Customized","value":"Customized"},{"label_en":"Condition","label_es":"Condition","value":"New"},{"label_en":"Control Type","label_es":"Control Type","value":"CNC"},{"label_en":"Automatic Grade","label_es":"Automatic Grade","value":"Automatic"},{"label_en":"Application","label_es":"Aplicación","value":"1-6 Stories Building"},{"label_en":"Connection","label_es":"Connection","value":"C/U Type"},{"label_en":"Width","label_es":"Ancho","value":"140mm, 152mm, 203mm, 254mm, 305mm"},{"label_en":"Flange Height","label_es":"Flange Height","value":"51mm"},{"label_en":"Thickness","label_es":"Espesor","value":"12-20gauge (1.0mm-2.5mm)"},{"label_en":"Return/Lip","label_es":"Return/Lip","value":"16mm to 20mm"}]', 'piece', 1, 15, 112000, array['https://image.made-in-china.com/203f0j00nyjVQTOCklYd/Fully-Automatic-Steel-Stud-Track-Roll-Forming-Machine-with-C-U-Shape.webp', 'https://image.made-in-china.com/203f0j00nOSlauyJQifm/Fully-Automatic-Steel-Stud-Track-Roll-Forming-Machine-with-C-U-Shape.webp', '