  ('frametec', 'building-material-machines', 'Cost Effective Size Adjustable Single C Purlin Roll Forming Machine 300mm Ls21', null, 'Cost Effective Size Adjustable Single C Purlin Roll Forming Machine 300mm Ls21. High Stability & Capacity: 16 roll forming stations driven by chain ensure high stability and production capacity. Wide Size Adaptability: Width range 75-300mm and thickness 1.0-3.0mm suit various specifications. Customized Configuration: Machine type, width, flange height, and thickness are fully customizable. Advanced PLC Control: Automatically controls quantity, punching length, and cutting length with precision. Fast Size Changing: CZ change time ranges from 5 to 15 minutes for efficient production. Durable Roller Material: Rollers made of Cr12 with vacuum heat treatment for long working life. Overseas After-Sales Support: Engineers available for overseas support to ensure machine reliability. Comprehensive Certifications: Equipped with CE and ISO9001 certifications for quality assurance.', null, '[{"label_en":"Customized","label_es":"Customized","value":"Customized"},{"label_en":"Condition","label_es":"Condition","value":"New"},{"label_en":"Control Type","label_es":"Control Type","value":"CNC"},{"label_en":"Automatic Grade","label_es":"Automatic Grade","value":"Automatic"},{"label_en":"Type","label_es":"Tipo","value":"C Purlin Machine"},{"label_en":"C Purlin Width","label_es":"C Purlin Width","value":"75-300mm"},{"label_en":"Flange Height","label_es":"Flange Height","value":"30-80mm"},{"label_en":"Thickness","label_es":"Espesor","value":"1.0-3.0mm"},{"label_en":"Return/Lip","label_es":"Return/Lip","value":"8-20mm"},{"label_en":"Driving","label_es":"Driving","value":"24A Single Chain"}]', 'piece', 1, 15, 40000, array['https://image.made-in-china.com/203f0j00deHMPgunEpkV/Cost-Effective-Size-Adjustable-Single-C-Purlin-Roll-Forming-Machine-300mm-Ls21.webp', 'https://image.made-in-china.com/203f0j00dMLCDVgFrzbl/Cost-Effective-Size-Adjustable-Single-C-Purli