  ('frametec', 'building-material-machines', 'Automatic Double Layer Corrugated Metal Roofing Sheet Roll Forming Machine', null, 'Automatic Double Layer Corrugated Metal Roofing Sheet Roll Forming Machine. Double Layer Roll Forming: Produces double layer roofing sheets with high precision and stable operation. Customized Design: Machine can be customized according to client requirements including size and function. 1 Year Warranty: Comes with a one-year free warranty covering mechanical defects and parts. Overseas Engineer Support: Engineers available for overseas installation and after-sales service support. High Production Efficiency: Forming speed of 20-25m/min saves time and labor with automatic operation. Durable Roller System: Rollers made of high grade forged steel with hard chrome plating for long life. PLC Control System: Automated control using Panasonic or Delta PLC for precise operation. Hydraulic Cutting: Automatic hydraulic post-cutting system controlled by PLC for accurate lengths. Double layer roof sheet roll forming machine supports two different roofing profiles in one compact production line, saving factory space and reducing equipment investment. Engineered for stable roll forming performance, this metal roofing sheet making machine produces uniform roof panels with consistent dimensions and reliable forming quality.', null, '[{"label_en":"Customized","label_es":"Customized","value":"Customized"},{"label_en":"Condition","label_es":"Condition","value":"New"},{"label_en":"Control Type","label_es":"Control Type","value":"CNC"},{"label_en":"Automatic Grade","label_es":"Automatic Grade","value":"Automatic"},{"label_en":"Description","label_es":"Description","value":"Double Layer Roll Forming Machine"},{"label_en":"Working Material","label_es":"Working Material","value":"Galvanized Sheet(Gi), Cold Roll Steel(CRC), Hot RO"},{"label_en":"Yield Strength","label_es":"Yield Strength","value":"235-345MPa"},{"label_en":"Punching","label_es":"Punching","value"