  ('jingyecopper', 'non-ferrous-metals', 'Cleaned Low Impurity Copper Scrap Wire for Metal Smelting', null, 'Cleaned Low Impurity Copper Scrap Wire for Metal Smelting. High Purity Copper Content: Minimum copper content of 99.9%, with test results reaching up to 99.99% for high-grade Millberry. Extensive Material Variety: Available in T1, T2, TP1, TP2, and numerous C-series grades like C10100 to C72200. Customizable Dimensions: Diameter ranges from 8mm to 10mm, with length and surface finishes tailored to customer requirements. Eco-Friendly Recycling: Recycling one ton saves 150 tons of copper ore, reduces energy consumption by 80%, and cuts CO2 emissions by 3 tons. Flexible Packaging Options: Standard export packaging suitable for all transport modes, or customized as per specific client needs. Global Export Capability: Exports to major markets including USA, Europe, India, and Southeast Asia with various Incoterms. Comprehensive Payment Terms: Accepts TT, L/C, Western Union, D/P, PayPal, and small-amount payments for flexible transactions. Full Customization Service: Offers full customization, minor customization, and flexible options based on samples or designs.', null, '[{"label_en":"Type","label_es":"Tipo","value":"Copper Wire"},{"label_en":"Color","label_es":"Color","value":"Yellow"},{"label_en":"Weight","label_es":"Peso","value":"3kg,5kg,7kg,15kg,20kg"},{"label_en":"Deliver Time","label_es":"Deliver Time","value":"Within 10-15 Days"},{"label_en":"Cu(Min)","label_es":"Cu(Min)","value":"99.9%"},{"label_en":"Alloy","label_es":"Aleación","value":"Non-Alloy"}]', 'kg', 1000, 15, 2.88, array['https://image.made-in-china.com/203f0j00VknCSiTrbloE/Cleaned-Low-Impurity-Copper-Scrap-Wire-for-Metal-Smelting.webp', 'https://image.made-in-china.com/203f0j00lknMjBahAVbQ/Cleaned-Low-Impurity-Copper-Scrap-Wire-for-Metal-Smelting.webp', 'https://image.made-in-china.com/203f0j00WkOvSFaRnVct/Cleaned-Low-Impurity-Copper-Scrap-Wire-for-Metal-Smelting.webp', 'https://image.made-in-ch