  ('ruidasteel', 'metal-coils-strips', 'Color Coated Steel Coils PPGI PPGL Prepainted Galvalume Steel Coils Az Coated Steel Coils', null, 'Color Coated Steel Coils PPGI PPGL Prepainted Galvalume Steel Coils Az Coated Steel Coils. Custom Color Options: Supports customization based on RAL color chart or customer samples. Anti-Corrosion Performance: Lasts 13 years in industrial areas, 50 years in ocean, and 30 years in cities. Metallurgical Bonding: Zinc coating is metallurgically bonded to steel for superior durability and toughness. Wide Thickness Range: Available in thicknesses from 0.12mm to 6.00mm to meet specific requirements. Multiple Coating Types: Offers PE, SMP, HDP, and PVDF coatings for varied durability and cost needs. 5-Year Warranty: Comprehensive 5-year warranty coverage for product quality assurance. Fast Delivery Time: Standard delivery within 7-15 days for efficient project scheduling. High Tensile Strength: Tensile strength ranges from 300-550MPa ensuring structural reliability.', null, '[{"label_en":"Product","label_es":"Product","value":"PPGI PPGL"},{"label_en":"Zinc Coating","label_es":"Zinc Coating","value":"40-275GSM"},{"label_en":"Az Coating","label_es":"Az Coating","value":"40-275"},{"label_en":"Standard","label_es":"Norma","value":"ASTM A653/792"},{"label_en":"Coils ID","label_es":"Coils ID","value":"508mm/610mm"},{"label_en":"Color","label_es":"Color","value":"Any Color"},{"label_en":"Package","label_es":"Embalaje","value":"International Standard Export Seaworthy Package"},{"label_en":"Delivery","label_es":"Delivery","value":"7-15 Days"},{"label_en":"Tensile Strength","label_es":"Tensile Strength","value":"300-550MPa"},{"label_en":"Top Painting","label_es":"Top Painting","value":"5+20microns"}]', 'ton', 10, 15, 600, array['https://image.made-in-china.com/203f0j00TunMzeicbOrg/Color-Coated-Steel-Coils-PPGI-PPGL-Prepainted-Galvalume-Steel-Coils-Az-Coated-Steel-Coils.webp', 'https://image.made-in-china.com/203f0j00HJakRGorVbuf/Color-Coated-Stee